Subject: [PATCH 3/3] =?UTF-8?q?[dev]=200012=20=E7=99=BB=E5=BD=95=E9=A1=B5?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E9=92=89=E9=92=89=E6=8C=89=E9=92=AE=E4=BF=9D=E7=95=99=20next?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

客户端 SSO 的设备参数（shib_*）坐在 next 的 query 里由 client_sso() 转发，
钉钉图标按钮裸 {% url "dingtalk_sso" %} 丢 next → 参数链全断 + 首次扫码落首页。
补 ?next= 写法对齐同文件 JS SSO 按钮；urlencode 保证内层 query 不被拆散。
---
 seahub/templates/registration/login.html | 4 +++-
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/seahub/templates/registration/login.html b/seahub/templates/registration/login.html
index 08e8cc3c..80aebf28 100644
--- a/seahub/templates/registration/login.html
+++ b/seahub/templates/registration/login.html
@@ -121,7 +121,9 @@ html, body, #wrapper { height:100%; }
       {% endif %}
 
       {% if enable_dingtalk %}
-        <a href="{% url "dingtalk_sso" %}">
+        {# [dev] 0012: 保留 next —— 客户端 SSO 的设备参数（shib_*）坐在 next 的 query 里，#}
+        {# 丢了 next 参数链全断，用户首次扫码落在首页而非回到客户端确认页。写法对齐上面 JS SSO 按钮。 #}
+        <a href="{% url "dingtalk_sso" %}{% if next %}?next={{ next|urlencode }}{% endif %}">
           <img src="{{MEDIA_URL}}img/dingtalk.png" width="32" alt="" title="{% if LANGUAGE_CODE == 'zh-cn' %}钉钉{% else %}DingTalk{% endif %}" />
         </a>
       {% endif %}
